starfleet/
----------

The Lean 4 sources under `starfleet/` were written by Colin Snyder
(Star Fleet Math, https://starfleetmath.com). They are not this repository's
work and are not covered by the MIT licence above. Copyright remains with the
author.

They are hosted here with the author's permission, so that Formal Conjectures
can point `formal_proof` links at a pinned, CI-audited copy at a stable path.
The author has confirmed the solutions are intended to be open for the
community, and is adding a licence to his own solution bundles; when that
licence is published it governs these files and this section should point at
it.

Each project under `starfleet/erdos-<N>/` is built and axiom-audited by
`.github/workflows/starfleet.yml`. Per-problem attribution and verdicts are in
`starfleet/README.md` and `starfleet/VERDICTS.md`, and in `proofs.yaml` under
`source: starfleetmath`.


Problem statements
------------------

Problem statements and commentary quoted in docstrings and in `proofs.yaml`
(`source: erdosproblems`) are from https://www.erdosproblems.com, maintained by
Thomas Bloom, and are used for identification and reference.
